#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/CSSLayerBlockRule.cpp (lines 1-93) and the inline members of
#       CSSLayerBlockRule.h (lines 15-37): the layer's name, the internal name of an anonymous
#       layer, its qualified name and serialization.
